INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(5699,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12185336','Synaptic vulnerability to amyloid-beta and tau pathologies differentially disrupts emotional and memory neural circuits.','Capilla-López MD, Deprada A, Andrade-Talavera Y, Martínez-Gallego I, Coatl-Cuaya H, Sotillo P, Rodríguez-Alvarez J, Rodríguez-Moreno A, Parra-Damas A, Saura CA.','2025','basolateral myelination synergize dimorphism dysconnectivity dominates synergize basolateral immunohistiochemical jax legends ceeah autonoma ceeah dmah cued cfc footshock unconditioned pairings pairings deparaffinized ser202 thr205 ser202 cp13 eclipse 80i stainings deparaffined z0334 wako alexafluor iggs hoechst lsm nextseq quasr rhisat2 deseq2 enrichr bioconductor sidak hocs padj 3rs grubbs camkiiα parvalbumin happ camkiiα vglut1 parvalbumin ctf ctfs moab ctfs ser202 thr205 ser202 thr205 ser202 cp13 ser202 cp13 insets basolateral sidak cued cfc neophobia mwm latencies latencies occupancies latencies cfc mwm mwm occupancies cfc cfc latencies cfc neophobia rnaseq littermate ugt2b34 prdx1 gstm1 gliogenesis ensheathment myelination bmp2 dlx2 cst7 itgax opalin tenm4 aif1 cd9 clu cnp cxcl5 sox10 cdk9 celf3 celf5 srsf7 ybx2 cacnb3 fgf13 dlg4 negr1 nptxr myelination d1m9x synaptosomes 63x homer1 insets dunnet synaptosomes synaptosomes psd95 homer1 amygdalar stp stp ppf epsc amplitudes fepsp fepsps stp ppf ppfs ppf stp ppf deregulated coordinately deregulated arhgap9 itgam lamp1 nfam1 stk10 ticam2 camk2a dlgap1 gria2 grin1 homer1 lrrk2 mapk8ip2 mink1 shank1 syn1 echs1 eci1 echdc3 hadha hadhb hsd17b4 oxidoreductase adrb2 bdh2 hspg2 itgb2 ncf1 rnls sirt2 sirt5 ccl6 csf1 cst7 itgax tyrobp stainings orthologs bin1 clu ms4a4a picalm plcg ptk2b slc24a4 sorl1 usp6nl deregulated ncs1 nkain2 pde7b slc24a4 slc4a8 tspan13 orthologs ahnak arhgap20 bcl3 celf1 clu inpp5d nkain2 pde7b stk32b rnaseq volcano log2fc deregulated orthologs magenta magenta hoechst insets basolateral padj padj cdon ferm kindlin fermt2 spondin